WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.940
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki. 12 years old!

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.690
For some reason... it so happened that we weren't able to get into her house!

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.360
That's because there was a spell invoked by a strange stone.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.620
Our voices couldn't reach her...

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.460
Letters didn't work either...{missing line}

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.630
"What should we do?"...we thought.

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:17.070
Takuto came up with an idea, and we managed to get rid of the spell.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:17.580
Geez...

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.080
It's amazing what can happen in one day.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.500
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.620
Do you understand?

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:29.730
Yes.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:21.320
Come on... we're here.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.530
This is where we're putting on the 
mini-concert today... Hiiragi Preschool.

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:25.570
Wow...

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:26.990
This is a great place.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:28.570
Which part of it?!

00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:32.790
I finally get to go out with Takuto, and it's a remote place in the mountains. This sucks! {dunno what the font scale change was for in this line, lol}

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.330
She wanted to come here no matter what.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:36.600
Ah, I see.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.230
She wanted to come that badly...

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:40.610
Well, well...

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.310
Thanks for coming such a long way.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:48.380
It was nothing. Thank you very much for inviting us.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.800
I'm the principal of the preschool, Date.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.140
Come on, everyone...

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:54.610
Let's greet <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.810
Ready and...

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.000
Good afternoon. I'm <i>Full Moon.</i>

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.110
Let's have a great time everyone, okay?

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:04.970
Wow!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:05.490
Cool!

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.150
She's so pretty!

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:07.590
So cute...

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:08.530
Sure is...

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:09.820
She's really here!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.740
I love her!

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:17.290
Eichi-kun.

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:27.540
Eichi-kun. {Alpha time}

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.260
Eichi-kun. {Alpha time}

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.340
Mitsuki. {not flashback}

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.410
Eichi-kun.

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:33.850
Mitsuki?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.230
Mitsuki?

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:37.930
Mitsuki!

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:38.560
Whoa?!

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.440
Ooshige-san!

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.360
Geez...

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.860
Staring off into space like that... what's wrong with you?

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.610
Well... that's... um....

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.410
Nothing at all.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:52.410
Geez... get a hold of yourself.

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.870
Hey, let me borrow this for a sec!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.740
I'll have <i>Full Moon</i>  sign it for you!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:56.980
Wait... that's...

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.660
That's Sora's!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.170
Taiki-kun... violence is not the answer.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:05.570
Oh.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.290
Your name's Taiki-kun?

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:16.060
Hmph.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.120
Taiki-kun!

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:19.770
Don't blame Taiki!

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:21.230
Taiki isn't bad!

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:22.480
Sora-chan...

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:25.160
Sora, let's go?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:25.820
Okay.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:29.960
Ah...

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.120
I'm really sorry about that.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.970
Please don't worry about it.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.170
I'm fine.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.960
Perhaps they aren't happy that <i>Full Moon</i> 's here.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.580
Oh... not at all...

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.790
Everyone is very receptive.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.550
Of course, I'm glad you're here as well.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.510
After receiving this picture...

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:53.600
...I just <i>had</i>  to come.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.760
Really?

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.470
The one who drew that...

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:59.780
...is actually Sora-chan from earlier.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:05.560
Sora-chan is a huge fan of yours.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:10.240
Television, magazines, she's seen them all.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:10.940
Wow.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.280
That makes me so happy.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:14.490
Um...

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:18.490
Are Sora-chan and Taiki-kun siblings?

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.830
Well... they aren't related.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.410
Sora-chan used to be very shy.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.750
Nobody could get close to her at all...

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:32.240
After Taiki-kun came, she became much more cheerful.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.800
It's just like they're family then, huh?

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:36.890
Even more than that...

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:41.280
I believe that those two have 
a bond deeper than family.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:47.060
Letter for the person you love

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.630
I'm home...

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:41.680
Um...

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.430
Is something wrong?

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:44.060
Ah!

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.600
U-Um...

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:46.790
Currently...

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:48.020
Currently...

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.630
Currently, we're conducting a mic test!

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:57.080
Sh-She's looking forward to singing so much, that <i>Full Moon</i>...

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:57.490
Right?

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:58.950
Y-Yeah!

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:01.530
Ah, I see... that's quite good...

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.370
It's probably that Eichi again.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.030
Ah...

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.120
So there is one today, too.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.500
The keyword is...

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.040
A storm of paper, huh?

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:10.000
A storm of paper?

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.310
It's probably something about the concert, right?

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:14.340
Whatever we do...

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:17.520
As long as we gather up all the paper in the area, we'll be fine.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.770
Come on... you'll help out too, Takuto.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.640
Whatever we do... leaving her by herself is definitely a bad idea.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.380
Hmph.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:27.970
Man...

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.980
Your belongings that came ahead of time are over here.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:33.400
Ah!

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.320
Taiki-kun!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.700
What are you doing in a place like this?!

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.320
Taiki-kun, right?

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:44.600
If you don't mind, can we talk for a bit?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.410
Mitsuki!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:51.620
Taiki-kun!

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.710
Are you okay, Mitsuki?!

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.560
I'm... fine. {Alpha-time}

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:56.520
I'm... fine. {Alpha-time}

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.630
It doesn't hurt at all.

00:08:58.630 --> 00:08:59.970
I'm so sorry.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.520
How could that child do such a thing...

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.550
No.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.080
I'm okay, really.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.100
Ah!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.680
Your costume's gone!

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:07.600
Eh?!

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:08.770
It couldn't be that...

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.100
...the boy took it?

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:10.890
Oh my.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.410
What shall we do?

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.700
I'll go get it back immediately.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.560
There's a limit on how far pranks can go!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:18.500
I am really sorry about this.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:19.570
Anyways...

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:21.320
...we have to get it back right away.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.280
Please wait!

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:23.950
Eh?

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:25.820
Please wait.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:29.450
We still don't know if it was Taiki-kun who pulled this prank.

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.140
Even if you say that...

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.620
...it's almost time for the concert.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:35.000
It's all right.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.000
If it comes down to it...

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.130
...I can still sing without my costume.

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:38.800
But...

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.970
Please don't judge that boy harshly.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:44.970
Besides... if he really took my costume...

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.140
I'm sure that there must be some reason behind it.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.180
So...

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.100
If you're going to put it that way Mitsuki, that's what we'll do.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.470
Thank you, Ooshige-san.

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:57.910
Ms. Principal... {Wow, no -sensei}

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.820
Can you show me the stage?

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.070
S-Sure...

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.400
Then, Mitsuki...

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:05.000
...I'm going on ahead.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.430
It hurts. {She's brave to be able to hide the pain for that long}

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:12.790
Stop forcing yourself.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:13.810
But...

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:16.970
That kid looks like Eichi, that's why you're sticking up for him, right?

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.650
That's not it.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.090
Mmm...

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.500
Maybe that's why?

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:24.980
For some reason, I just have this strange feeling...

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.340
Right now, I am...

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.510
A sixteen-year-old...

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:28.550
<i>Full Moon...</i>

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:29.600
But...

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.160
Here inside me...

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.740
The me and Eichi-kun of the past...

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.560
...still exists.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.060
Where are you going?

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:41.480
Your costume.

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.890
I'm going to look for it.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.780
What's so funny?!

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:49.620
Takuto really is a good person, just like I thought!

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.790
T-That's not it!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.080
I'm just doing my job as a Shinigami! {shani: since when shinigami's role included looking for stolen costume :D Yappari, Takuto wa ii hito da!}

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.370
Job?!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:56.660
That's not it at all.

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.480
Who are you kidding, you're doing it for Mitsuki, dummy!

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:01.040
Takuto, you dummy!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:02.840
Ah!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.050
I can't take it anymore!

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.510
Full Moon

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.510
Welcome

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.930
This is the motif we had in mind when we were setting up, though...

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:13.260
Wow... it's so adorable!

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:14.430
Yep! It feels good!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:16.020
Ms. Principal.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:16.360
Hmm?

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.520
Good afternoon.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.520
That guy...

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.990
Where'd he go off to?

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:26.440
Ah?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.950
So this guy did it after all.

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:33.330
I'll take it back.

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:34.290
Ah?

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.160
What's going on?

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.330
Takuto... hasn't come back yet.

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:31.400
Now then...

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.550
Everybody join in.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:35.680
Welcome to Hiiragi Preschool...

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:50.780
Eh?

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:52.830
Huh?

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:53.990
What could have happened?

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.040
Excuse me, <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:03.350
This kid cut the power line.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:04.880
Taiki-kun?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.600
Someone like you...

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.300
I hate you!

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:09.130
Eh?

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.550
Let me go!

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:11.510
Hey!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.940
Wait, Taiki!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.020
Taiki!

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.190
I'm really sorry about this.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.610
Just when we were all ready to begin...

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:34.060
This is a problem.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.660
At this rate, we'll have to cancel the concert...

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:38.080
Please wait!

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:41.040
There must be a reason.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.500
You're still saying that?

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.250
Because...

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:44.990
Taiki-kun and Sora-chan... {Fixed erroneous honorific}

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.620
...are so close.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.420
Sora-chan was looking forward to the concert...

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.680
For Taiki-kun to be pulling a prank...

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.050
...just to get in the way...

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:55.010
I can't believe that.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:56.340
Even if you say that...

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:59.220
That boy's the one who caused all this trouble.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.680
So it's about <i>that</i>  after all, huh?

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:03.280
Eh?

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:04.800
Actually...

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:07.720
There has been a discussion about Sora-chan getting adopted...

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.900
It has been going very well.

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:10.920
Just that...

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:14.950
Sora-chan was looking forward to the concert, so...

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.740
Today is the day when it will all be finalized, so...

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:19.330
...she'll be turned over afterwards.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.200
Then...

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.450
What about Taiki-kun?

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:23.920
They'll be separated?

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:27.720
There's no way for both of them to go together.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.430
It must hurt so much... Taiki-kun...

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:45.640
Ms. Principal!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.270
Taiki and Sora have disappeared!

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.400
Eh?!

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.400
Eh?!

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.400
Eh?!

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.520
Sora-chan!

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:57.860
Where are you, Sora-chan?!

00:14:58.200 --> 00:14:59.820
Taiki-kun!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.350
Hey!

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:03.290
Please come back!

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.800
Sora!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.390
Taiki-kun!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.250
Sora-chan!

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:11.730
Where'd they go... those two...

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:13.000
Ah.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.170
Meroko!

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:15.340
Please!

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:16.970
Can you look for them from the sky?

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.010
You know...

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:20.840
We aren't your servants.

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:24.390
We're busy with our work as Shinigami, first and foremost...

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:26.080
That's all I ask.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:29.100
I can totally understand how Taiki-kun feels.

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:33.570
Even though he messed up your concert...

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.280
After the concert's over...

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.400
...they'll be separated...

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:38.780
So in order to keep that from happening...

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.480
...Taiki-kun was desperate!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.120
If you're talking about those two, they're at the top of the hill.

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:44.740
Ah?

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:45.860
Takuto!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:46.660
I got it!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.960
The top of the hill, right?

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:49.040
Geez...

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.470
You helped her out again!

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.210
Huh?

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.150
Takuto! Where are you going?!

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:54.960
Meroko!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.550
You come along too.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.140
Mitsuki, where are you going?!

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:06.280
Come to think of it...

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:09.080
Just earlier... the top of the hill...

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.650
Someone mentioned they saw two who looked just like Taiki and Sora. {edited}

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:17.150
Ah.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.120
Hold on tight.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.130
We're flying all the way to the hill.

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:21.660
Okay!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:25.120
Since I get to hold hands with Takuto, it doesn't matter if you're here too.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.250
Ah! Over there!

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:36.630
Taiki-kun!

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:37.740
Sora-chan!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.470
Don't come any closer!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:41.590
You're not taking Sora anywhere!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.300
I won't go!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.760
I want to be with Taiki!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:50.910
Have faith!

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.630
Having to part is sad, but...

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.730
But you have all of eternity!

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.680
As long as you have those feelings of not wanting to part...

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.230
As long as they are strong enough...

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.390
...you'll definitely find each other again!

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:02.410
How could someone like you understand?!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:10.620
You'll see each other.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.290
We'll meet up again... I sing because I want to believe that.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:19.260
To believe that... we'll surely 
see each other again...

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.050
That's why...

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.440
Even if you're separated from Sora-chan...

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.930
...you won't be alone, Taiki-kun.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.890
You'll always be together... 
underneath the same sky...

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.890
If you wish hard enough...

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:40.860
...it'll feel like you're next to each other.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:41.790
Definitely!

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:44.310
Taiki...

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:49.780
Will we really see each other again?

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:50.490
Yep.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:53.990
Sora...

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.740
No matter how far we're apart... I won't forget.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:57.950
Me neither.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:06.420
Ms. Principal.

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:07.920
We've changed our minds.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:10.310
We'd like to take both of them in.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.350
To let those two go through 
such a sad separation...

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.160
We couldn't possibly do that.

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:20.520
Taiki-kun, nice to meet you.

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.270
From now on, the two of you will really be siblings.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:23.980
Okay!

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:23.980
Okay! {Seperate timings}

00:20:23.980 --> 00:20:25.210
Aren't you relieved?

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:33.160
I truly am!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:34.630
Here...

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:35.660
You can have it back.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:37.530
I'm sorry.

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:38.870
Thank you.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.460
Congratulations!

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:45.670
I'm happy for them. {Untranslated, but I'll give it my best shot}

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:47.000
I'm really happy for them!

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:47.520
Ah...

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.050
Isn't it great?

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:56.670
Huh? What is?

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:57.360
Ah!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:58.950
Ah!!!

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.850
This is the storm of paper?!

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:04.200
Shinigami Chief will be so mad at me! {because the othe line was guesslation}

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.690
Come on, <i>Full Moon.</i>

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:07.690
Let's go do the concert...

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:09.650
Let's head back to Hiiragi Preschool.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:11.540
Okay.

00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:06.440
Takuto!

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.690
Hurry, hurry!

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:10.000
We got a message from the Chief!

00:23:10.000 --> 00:23:11.480
If we're late... it'll be a problem.

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:12.860
H-Hold on a sec!

00:23:12.860 --> 00:23:15.650
If we're both gone, will she be okay?!

00:23:15.650 --> 00:23:18.240
Geez... you worry so much, Takuto.

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:19.990
If you transform her...

00:23:19.990 --> 00:23:23.480
...that manager, Ooshige, will do something about it.

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:25.870
No, it looks like <i>that</i>  manager's on vacation today.

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:26.250
Gah!

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.270
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:31.630
Go for Broke! Substitute Manager{full stop removed for consistency}
